        "focus_and_disposition": "六艺考信、禅让与许由等异闻，正义所引洗耳传说和月地只作后出材料。"
      },
      {
        "anchor": "p2",
        "source_path": "sources/史记三家注/卷061.md",
        "linked_units": [
          "P001"
        ],
        "read_status": "full_paragraph_and_all_commentary_read",
        "raw_sha256": "eedb530038f7997ee469cbaa278997759bdfbd38d003e4b7085ca05d3db8b021",
        "focus_and_disposition": "余登箕山与许由冢传闻、史家疑说者；索隐推太史公曰为后加不作定论。"
      },
      {
        "anchor": "p3",
        "source_path": "sources/史记三家注/卷061.md",
        "linked_units": [
          "P002",
          "P003"
        ],
        "read_status": "full_paragraph_and_all_commentary_read",
        "raw_sha256": "c26d3033c70a85ffb120b9aa43728582278e50d0876b5984e5557ebb2f7505a2",
        "focus_and_disposition": "孔子论怨与逸诗、孤竹让位、归周次序、叩马、五处首阳、薇异释和完整采薇歌。"
      },
      {
        "anchor": "p4",
        "source_path": "sources/史记三家注/卷061.md",
        "linked_units": [
          "P004"
        ],
        "read_status": "full_paragraph_and_all_commentary_read",
        "raw_sha256": "ee0051ea844a8b3ca475584f1ecee911d2d0f15e6e881fa587f821396c32021a",
        "focus_and_disposition": "怨邪非邪仍作史家疑问。"
      },
      {
        "anchor": "p5",
        "source_path": "sources/史记三家注/卷061.md",
        "linked_units": [
          "P005"
        ],
        "read_status": "full_paragraph_and_all_commentary_read",
        "raw_sha256": "10e31d15d708cf3cabc4300ecf1da06055c4fc55a970600c77d89e94c6940818",
        "focus_and_disposition": "颜回贫夭、盗跖暴而寿终、肝人肉与近世遭遇；未据古注例名另编年。"
      },
      {
        "anchor": "p6",
        "source_path": "sources/史记三家注/卷061.md",
        "linked_units": [
          "P005"
        ],
        "read_status": "full_paragraph_and_all_commentary_read",
        "raw_sha256": "5f0dbb9b67a45296b404279b2ff27a6d3fbf827a3a3e6e09a5d914d3dc771921",
        "focus_and_disposition": "余甚惑焉与傥的未定语气；不改成作者已经否定天道。"
      },
      {
        "anchor": "p7",
        "source_path": "sources/史记三家注/卷061.md",
        "linked_units": [
          "P006"
        ],
        "read_status": "full_paragraph_and_all_commentary_read",
        "raw_sha256": "d984de20ea85e1dd049f0afcd29e5f9e447612e15706b4083ce22ae2f8bb624f",
        "focus_and_disposition": "富贵可求须合道、岁寒松柏、轻重两解；不说成松柏全凋或自主选择贫富。"
      },
      {
        "anchor": "p8",
        "source_path": "sources/史记三家注/卷061.md",
        "linked_units": [
          "P007"
        ],
        "read_status": "full_paragraph_and_all_commentary_read",
        "raw_sha256": "98d66ddaa75011515b003118c0208a0741eb56dbe395407c3833c7fe7002849c",
        "focus_and_disposition": "贾子鵩鸟赋、馮生、易语与传名、附骥尾、青云之士；古注引司马迁自序不并作商末。"
      },
      {
        "anchor": "p9",
